# Orchestrator/dev bookkeeping — git-tracked (durable across disposable sessions per the
# continuity protocol) but MUST NOT ship in the published @gravity-7/meridianos-core tarball.
# NOTE: when this file exists, npm uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore for packaging. node_modules,
# .git, and friends are always auto-excluded by npm regardless.
.npmrc.publish
.ai/
.mos-worktrees/
OWNERSHIP.md
RESUME-PROMPT.md
